WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.390 --> 00:00:04.759
Baychester Middle School is located in the
Edenwald section of the Bronx.

00:00:04.759 --> 00:00:09.840
Most of our students are qualified for Title
One, which means that the majority of our

00:00:09.840 --> 00:00:12.750
students are low-income students.

00:00:12.750 --> 00:00:17.279
My goal with teaching sixth-grade science
is primarily focused on engagement because

00:00:17.279 --> 00:00:23.269
I feel if students are engaged, and interested,
they will then want to continue to study.

00:00:23.269 --> 00:00:28.810
So without that initial engagement, or really
enjoyment of learning, they’re not going

00:00:28.810 --> 00:00:33.030
to want to pursue science at later ages.

00:00:33.030 --> 00:00:35.199
So I do a lot of hands-on activities.

00:00:35.199 --> 00:00:43.449
I try to mix things a lot with visuals, kinesthetic
examples, songs, movement — body movements

00:00:43.449 --> 00:00:48.410
— in different ways so that students remember
the content and also are engaged and are enjoying

00:00:48.410 --> 00:00:49.250
being in class.

